  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Based on Chris&Aaron discussion about this thread: ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://git.661346.n2.nabble.com/possible-gitattributes-eol-bug-with-new-eol-crlf-lf-support-td5516458.html"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://git.661346.n2.nabble.com/possible-gitattributes-eol-bug-with-new-eol-crlf-lf-support-td5516458.html",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "We decided this would be a good approach:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "1. Modify all text as per the thread suggestion to use LFs",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "2. Modify our pom to automatically dos-ify the batch files in the assembly using the lineEnding attribute documented here: ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://maven.apache.org/plugins/maven-assembly-plugin/assembly.html"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://maven.apache.org/plugins/maven-assembly-plugin/assembly.html",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "3. Publish recommended settings for git users, which are to set core.autocrlf to \"input\" (that is, force LF for line endings on check in only) if you're running Mac/Linux, and to set it to \"true\" (that is, force LF when checking in, but convert to native CRLF when checking out).  But if you're running git 1.7.2+, it's not required that you set it in your global config at all.  Instead, you can rely on the .gitattributes file described below.",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "4. Add a .gitattributes file to auto-convert all known text-based formats' line endings for people running git 1.7.2+ who haven't set core.autocrlf globally.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
